{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40008","headline":"闻长安庚子岁事 · 徐夤","name":"闻长安庚子岁事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽檄交驰触冕旒，函关飞入铁兜鍪。\n皇王去国未爲恨，寰海失君方是忧。\n五色大云凝蜀郡，几般妖气扑神州。\n唐尧纵禅乾坤位，不是重华莫谩求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}